15. The trial participant must be able and willing to comply with the protocol-specified visits, treatment plan, laboratory tests, and other study-related procedures.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Use of chemotherapy, biotherapy, immunotherapy, or similar treatments within 4 weeks or 5 half-lives prior to the first dose;
2. Receipt of immunosuppressive drug therapy within 2 weeks prior to the first dose;
